      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于是，",
        "$(5x^2+7x-8)+(-3x^2-6x+9)=2x^2+x+1$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例2．把多项式的差：",
        "$(10a^3-4a^2-16)-(-6a^3+8a-80)$",
        "变形成标准形式的多项式．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "如果括号前面是“$-$”号，那么，把括号和它前面的“$-$”号",
        "去掉，括号里面各项都变号：",
        "$(10a^3-4a^2-16)-(-6a^3+8a-80)$",
        "$=10a^3-4a^2-16+6a^3-8a+80$",
        "$=16a^3-4a^2-8a+64$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，得到恒等式：",
        "$(10a^3-4a^2-16)-(-6a^3+8a-80)$",
        "$=16a^3-4a^2-8a+64$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "多项式 $5a^2+9a^5-7a^4-a^3+12-a$ 的各项可以按照任何顺序排",
        "列．例如，可以按照变量 $a$ 的幂指数逐渐减少的顺序排列：",
        "$9a^5-7a^4-a^3+5a^2-a+12$",
        "或者按照变量 $a$ 的幂指数逐渐增加的顺序来排列：",
        "$12-a+5a^2-a^3-7a^4+9a^5$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "前一种情况，叫做多项式按照变量 $a$ 的降幂排列；后一种情况，叫做多",
        "项式按照变量 $a$ 的升幂排列．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在作整式的恒等变形时，经常要适当地将多项式按照某一个变量",
        "的降幂排列或者升幂排列．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了把已经排列好的几个多项式的和或差变成一个多项式，有时",
        "写成“竖式”比较方便，也就是把一个多项式的各项写在另外一个多项",
        "式的同类项下面："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1）$(5b^4+7b^3-11b^2-8b+9)+(-3b^4+5b^3+16b^2-7)$",
        "$\\phantom{1）(5b^4+7b^3-11b^2-8b+9)}+(-13b^3+b^2+6b-1)$"
      ]
    },
